[00:29.92]Jehovah, you always have been,
[00:34.30]And always you will be.
[00:42.20]You’ve given the throne to your Son;
[00:46.91]He rules by your decree.
[00:53.44]The Kingdom has been brought to birth;
[00:59.40]His rulership will fill the earth.
[01:04.87](Chorus)
[01:05.02]For now have come to pass
[01:08.79]Salvation and kingdom and might.
[01:14.20]The Kingdom is in place.
[01:18.85]We pray: “Let it come, Let it come!”
[01:23.78]The time for the Devil is short;
[01:29.46]We know what this will mean.
[01:35.04]Though living in times of distress,
[01:39.54]We see the things unseen.
[01:44.28]The Kingdom has been brought to birth;
[01:48.88]His rulership will fill the earth.
[01:53.41](Chorus)
[01:53.56]For now have come to pass
[01:57.95]Salvation and kingdom and might.
[02:02.70]The Kingdom is in place.
[02:07.20]We pray: “Let it come, Let it come!”
[02:18.54]The angels in heaven rejoice
[02:22.06]And sing with joyful cries.
[02:27.60]The heavens above are relieved
[02:32.10]From Satan and his lies.
[02:37.10]The Kingdom has been brought to birth;
[02:41.54]His rulership will fill the earth.
[02:47.27](Chorus)
[02:47.42]For now have come to pass
[02:50.94]Salvation and kingdom and might.
[02:56.60]The Kingdom is in place.
[03:01.12]We pray: “Let it come, Let it come!”
